  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "Marco_Longspeech",
  "description": "\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tMarco-LongSpeech Dataset\n\t\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nMarco-LongSpeech is a multi-task long speech understanding dataset containing 8 different speech understanding tasks designed to benchmark Large Language Models on lengthy audio inputs.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\ud83d\udcca Dataset Statistics\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tTask Statistics\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\nTask\nTrain\nVal\nTest\nTotal\nUnique Audios\n\n\n\t\t\nASR\n71,275\n15,273\n15,274\n101,822\n101,822\n\n\nTemporal_Relative_QA\n5,886\n1,261\n1,262\n8,409\n8,409\n\n\nsummary\n4,366\n935\n937\n6,238\n6,238\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/ATH-MaaS/Marco_Longspeech.",
